findings.remediation:
Use AWS credentials from environment variables, shared credentials file, or IAM roles for EC2 instead of hardcoding them. Remove the `access_key` and `secret_key` attributes and rely on the default credential chain.

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  alias   = "secure_provider"
  region  = "us-west-1"
  // Remove access_key and secret_key
}
```
